Director of Corporate Communications &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by fans, Crunchyroll delivers the art and culture of anime to a passionate community. We super-serve over 100 million anime and manga fans across 200+ countries and territories, and help them connect with the stories and characters they crave. Whether that experience is online or in-person, streaming video, theatrical, games, merchandise, events and more, it’s powered by the anime content we all love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Director of Corporate Communications will work alongside the Communications leadership team to promote, manage, and support the Crunchyroll story in business and trade press; key initiatives and corporate events like the Crunchyroll Anime Awards and Anime Future Forum;&amp;nbsp; liaise with SPE and SGC on initiatives, events and storytelling; and manage corporate presence at industry events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will also work with key leadership with Product, Engineering, Legal, People Experience, Strategy, Finance and IT/Security for dynamic storytelling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Senior Director of Communications, the leader in this role will support Crunchyroll’s industry narrative.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders to develop consumer and business media campaigns for a mix of news across lines of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage media outreach and relationship-building with reporters across business, tech, trade and consumer publications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alongside the Senior Director of Communications, craft foundational materials including press releases, presentations, bios, internal communications, talking points, statements, pitches, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage corporate storytelling and media around major Crunchyroll events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curate external speaking opportunities for major industry events in a handful of key subject areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with media – specifically trade/business and select industry trades, on industry and business stories, especially as it relates to reporters in the retail, consumer products, and technical / engineering space.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Corporate Relations by working with teams in Sony Group to amplify Crunchyroll’s story as well as support presentations, events, and other initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage corporate storytelling within Japan, including managing an agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage internal communications as needed and under the direction of the VP of Internal Communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performs other duties as requested&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely organized with strong follow-through and time management skills. 12+ years of hands on leadership experience within corporate communications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong initiative and highly motivated: Effectively responds to pressure while maintaining professionalism. Uses resources well. Must possess a “can-do” and “will-do” attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive energy level and enthusiasm for the position. Must have the willingness to learn and improve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to juggle multiple projects at once and prioritize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be flexible to change, a creative thinker and problem solver, and accustomed to working in teams as well as a self-starting individual&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to anticipate issues, be proactive and problem solve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent and professional communication skills (spoken and written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with anime, pop culture and current entertainment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing book of media contacts across business, tech, and trade publications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with C-Suite executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to travel domestically and internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Crunchyroll Communications team is a nimble group of publicists who love talking about anime, our brand, and the broader streaming entertainment industry. We’re storytellers and we connect our passionate fans to the content they love through thoughtful press around our fan-centric touchpoints (SVOD, theatrical, events, games, merchandise, and more).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you will love working at Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to getting to work with fun, passionate and inspired colleagues, you will also enjoy the following benefits and perks:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive a great compensation package including salary plus performance bonus earning potential, paid annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off policies allowing you to take the time you need to be your whole self.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous medical, dental, vision, LTD, and life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Saving Account HSA program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health care and dependent care FSA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan, with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer paid commuter benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support program for new parents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet insurance and some of our offices are pet friendly!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LifeAtCrunchyroll #LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About our Values&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to be everything for someone rather than something for everyone and we do this by living and modeling our values in all that we do. We value&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Courage. We believe that when we overcome fear, we enable our best selves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity. We are curious, which is the gateway to empathy, inclusion, and understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kaizen. We have a growth mindset committed to constant forward progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Service. We serve our community with humility, enabling joy and belonging for others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our commitment to diversity and inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission of helping people belong reflects our commitment to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion. It&#39;s just the way we do business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at Crunchyroll. Pursuant to applicable law, we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll, LLC is an independently operated joint venture between US-based Sony Pictures Entertainment, and Japan&#39;s Aniplex, a subsidiary of Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc., both subsidiaries of Tokyo-based Sony Group Corporation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Questions about Crunchyroll’s hiring process? Please check out our Hiring FAQs:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs&quot;&gt;https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;Candidate Privacy Policy for more information about how we process your personal information, and your data protection rights: &lt;a href=&quot;https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf&quot;&gt;https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please beware of recent scams to online job seekers. Those applying to our job openings will only be contacted directly from ----- email account.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Communications  London

Senior Engineer I, Total Product Support &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job’s mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineer, Total Product Support&lt;/strong&gt; at ASM, you will take ownership of highly visible technical projects and drive them from planning through execution and delivery. Acting as the central point connecting engineering teams, operations, and customers, you will ensure that technical solutions are developed, tested, implemented, and supported successfully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone with a strong engineering foundation who enjoys bringing people together, solving problems, and turning technical requirements into clear actions. You do not need to be the subject matter expert in every technical area, but you should be comfortable working with engineers, understanding complex technical concepts, asking the right questions, and keeping projects moving forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and coordinate technical projects from initial planning through execution, customer delivery, and program close-out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop execution plans, define priorities, coordinate resources, and ensure key project milestones and deliverables are achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central point of coordination between engineering teams, technical specialists, operations, management, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the build and qualification phase of technical solutions, including coordinating in-house testing, additional test equipment, technical evaluations, and readiness for customer implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineers to understand technical challenges, determine where additional expertise or consultation is required, and drive issues toward resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate directly with customers to understand requirements, provide transparent project updates, and support successful technical implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor project progress, identify risks and roadblocks early, and communicate openly when plans, deliverables, or timelines are at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze project and test outcomes, coordinate follow-up activities, and ensure programs are properly completed and transitioned into customer support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steer operational activities across multiple stakeholders while maintaining accountability for overall project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear and concise reporting on high-visibility projects to stakeholders and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Mechanical Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Physics, Materials Science&lt;/strong&gt;, or another relevant technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid engineering foundation and the ability to understand and communicate technical concepts across different engineering disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project coordination skills with the ability to plan, organize, and drive activities from start to finish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills, including the confidence to work with engineers, managers, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of ownership and accountability, with a proactive and hands-on approach to solving problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify risks, communicate challenges transparently, and escalate issues when necessary rather than waiting for problems to resolve themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly learn new technologies, processes, and technical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy, adaptability, and a strong “can-do” mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively both independently and as part of a multidisciplinary team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in semiconductor equipment, high-tech manufacturing, mechanical/electrical systems, or another complex engineering environment (not required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating multidisciplinary teams and translating between technical specialists, operations, management, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Relevant professional, internship, research, or project experience demonstrating the ability to coordinate technical work and drive execution is an advantage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and the confidence to challenge assumptions, raise concerns, and create alignment across different stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured approach to project execution combined with the flexibility to adapt when technical priorities change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable taking accountability for highly visible projects where clear and timely communication is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally, typically &lt;strong&gt;1–2 times per year&lt;/strong&gt;, depending on project and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a> SU3.Metal Dep- VF KPU

Associate Director - Credit &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Since 2004, we’ve been bringing investment ideas to life and connecting capital with the right people and opportunities. Today, we manage more than £2.5 billion for a broad range of investors across five key investment strategies: Private Credit,&amp;nbsp;Social Housing, Clean Heat, Energy and Venture. These strategies underpin the innovative range of investments we offer to both private (retail) and institutional clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;There are 230+ employees at Triple Point, all committed to leaving the world demonstrably better than we found it. That’s why we’re a certified B Corp, signed up to the Principles for Responsible Investment, and were named a Sunday Times &lt;em&gt;&#39;Best Places to Work&amp;nbsp; 2025 &amp;amp; 2026&#39;&lt;/em&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;f this sounds like an environment where you would flourish, then read on…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Function &amp;amp; Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Credit &amp;amp; Risk team&lt;/strong&gt; sits within the Group Risk &amp;amp; Compliance function and provides independent oversight across the Private Credit platform. Partnering with lending and portfolio management teams throughout the lending lifecycle, the team establishes and maintains the governance, frameworks and oversight that support consistent lending decisions, effective portfolio management and effective restructuring across all of Private Credit&#39;s lending strategies.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Credit &amp;amp; Risk team members&lt;/strong&gt; work collaboratively across credit underwriting, portfolio monitoring, restructuring, recoveries and assurance, providing specialist expertise across all of Private Credit&#39;s lending strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Review &amp;amp; Risk Identification&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with, and ultimately take ownership of, portfolio review processes in partnership with portfolio management teams, ensuring early identification of risk and emerging trends across all lending strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exercise delegated authority for non-material credit requests, escalating appropriately where thresholds are exceeded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to watchlist and early warning indicator processes, flagging deteriorating credits for further action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute case-level input to Lessons Learnt processes, covering challenged cases, watchlist trends and emerging risk themes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Credit Underwriting Support &amp;amp; Origination Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with origination teams to evaluate new lending opportunities, providing&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;credit expertise and challenge at the appropriate stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review credit papers ahead of submission from time to time, providing a clear recommendation to Credit Committee members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong working relationships with origination and portfolio management teams to ensure credit input is embedded early and effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Reporting &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and present internal reporting materials on portfolio health, performance and emerging trends for senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ad-hoc credit advisory support to portfolio management teams on existing positions as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute portfolio-level insight and findings into wider Credit &amp;amp; Risk reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and help implement improvements to credit processes, frameworks and monitoring tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive efficiency through automation, reporting improvements and AI-enabled workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to ad-hoc credit projects and process initiatives where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ssential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in credit risk, credit analysis or portfolio management within a lending, private credit, or credit advisory environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial analysis and credit assessment skills, with the ability to review and challenge credit papers and identify key risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with portfolio monitoring or review processes, including identifying early signs of credit deterioration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable exercising judgement and holding delegated authority for credit decisions within defined parameters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to prepare clear reporting materials and provide credit recommendations to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educated to degree level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work autonomously, build effective relationships across teams, and constructively challenge origination and portfolio management colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specific experience in private credit, alternative lending or direct lending (as opposed to traditional bank lending).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to mid-market/SME lending; familiarity with wholesale lending structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with watchlist frameworks, early warning indicators, or provisioning/impairment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or improving credit risk frameworks, monitoring tools or reporting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using or implementing AI-enabled tools in a credit or risk context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with credit documentation and risk rating tools is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Qualities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical and detail-oriented&lt;/strong&gt;, with sound judgement when reviewing credit papers and portfolio data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confident exercising independent judgement&lt;/strong&gt; within delegated authority, and clear about when to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A constructive challenger,&lt;/strong&gt; able to provide credit input and push back on origination or portfolio management colleagues diplomatically but firmly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative&lt;/strong&gt;, building strong working relationships across origination, portfolio management and Credit &amp;amp; Risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator&lt;/strong&gt;, able to distil portfolio trends and risk into reporting that&#39;s useful to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organised&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to manage multiple portfolio reviews and reporting deadlines concurrently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious and proactive&lt;/strong&gt;, with a genuine interest in improving credit processes rather than just following them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with change&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly given this role is expected to grow in scope and ownership over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll join a talented, collaborative team in a connected environment where ideas and initiative are valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a growing and innovative team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer a competitive salary, a comprehensive benefits package, and genuine opportunities for growth and progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for professional development and career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Triple Point, high performance means living our values every day:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay Curious. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Generous. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take Thoughtful Action. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pull Together.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own It.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In line with our values &lt;em&gt;Stay Curious&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Take Thoughtful Action&lt;/em&gt; every employee has access to AI tools. We see technology as a co-pilot, helping us improve efficiency and insight while keeping decisions grounded in thoughtful human judgement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Triple Point offers a wealth of benefits including a contributory pension, hybrid/flexible working and ongoing learning and development opportunities. Check out our comprehensive list of benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.triplepoint.co.uk/careers/42/&quot;&gt;HERE&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
